Convert this Dagster job (marketing_dataflow_job) to Orchestra pipeline YAML. Note this is a Power BI DATAFLOW refresh (not a dataset/semantic-model refresh), hand-rolled via a custom ConfigurableResource since dagster-powerbi has no official dataflow support:

```python
import os
import requests
from dagster import op, job, ConfigurableResource

class PowerBIDataflowResource(ConfigurableResource):
    tenant_id: str
    client_id: str
    client_secret: str
    workspace_id: str

    def _token(self):
        return "FAKE_TOKEN"  # msal client-credential flow omitted for brevity

    def refresh_dataflow(self, dataflow_id: str):
        token = self._token()
        headers = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {token}"}
        resp = requests.post(
            f"https://api.powerbi.com/v1.0/myorg/groups/{self.workspace_id}/dataflows/{dataflow_id}/refreshes",
            headers=headers,
        )
        resp.raise_for_status()

@op
def refresh_marketing_dataflow(powerbi: PowerBIDataflowResource):
    powerbi.refresh_dataflow(dataflow_id=os.environ["MARKETING_DATAFLOW_ID"])

@job
def marketing_dataflow_job():
    refresh_marketing_dataflow()
```
